<title>USA: Aegis Consumer restates Q4, FY EPS higher.</title>
<headline>Aegis Consumer restates Q4, FY EPS higher.</headline>
<dateline>JERSEY CITY, N.J. 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aegis Consumer Funding Group said on Wednesday it has restated its net income per share for the fourth quarter ended June 1996 to $0.19 a share from the previously reported $0.18 a share.</p>
<p>For the fiscal year ended June 1996, the company restated its earnings to $0.65 a share from the previously reported $0.63 a share.</p>
<p>The change was from a computational error in the calculation of primary and fully diluted earnings per share.</p>
</text>
